---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="AI Projects">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">AI Projects</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-slate-500">Selected technical work and public demonstrations</p>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8">
    <article class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Local and Private AI Infrastructure</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        Architecture and implementation approaches for local LLM deployment, privacy controls, and inference methods suitable for sensitive environments.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Enterprise AI Modernization</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        Technical approaches to integrating AI capabilities into existing organizational systems, with emphasis on measurable outcomes and practical constraints.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Agentic AI Systems</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        Design, evaluation methodology, reliability, and security considerations for autonomous AI agent architectures.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500">
    Case studies will be expanded with publicly available technical details and demonstrations.
  </p>
</Layout>
